      "passive_list": {
        "8": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<p>When you cause one or more allies to <strong>recover Hit Points and/or Mind Points</strong>, </p><p>each of those allies recovers <strong>5 additional Hit Points and/or Mind Points</strong> </p><p></p><p>and you choose a status effect from among <strong>dazed, enraged, poisoned, shaken, slow,</strong> and <strong>weak</strong>: </p><p>each of those allies <strong>recovers </strong>from the chosen status effect.</p><p></p><p>The recovery effect increases to 10 Hit Points and/or Mind Points if you are level 30 or higher.</p><p>You also gain the ability to perform Rituals of the <strong>Spiritism</strong> discipline</p>",
          "passive_name": " PLANET ORACLE",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "quirk"
        },
        "9": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<p><strong>Target: self</strong></p><p>Once before the next rest, if you are about to suffer one or more status effects from</p><p>the same source, you may instead choose not to suffer any of those status effects.</p><hr><p>While you perform training, Others remain silent.</p><p><em>Like there is nothing but your song allowed in that hall.</em></p>",
          "passive_name": "Music Training",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "camp activity"
        },
        "10": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<p><strong>Target: One ally</strong></p><p>Once before the next rest, after the target performs a Group Check as leader or</p><p>performs a Check to <strong>negotiate, communicate</strong> with someone or something, they may add a bonus of +4 to the Result of that Check.</p><hr><p><em>\"Ah.. the Dreamers song..</em></p><p><em>Someone said the miracle always happen to those who hear it..\"<br>Time to share love and harmony!</em></p>",
          "passive_name": "Singing",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "camp activity"
        }
      },
